<title>USA: Network General names officer.</title>
<headline>Network General names officer.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network General Corp said Tuesday it promoted David Carver to the position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Carver, 50, joined Netwok General in November 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Establishing a chief operating officer position in the company contributes measurably to the success of our business unit concept which we established last summer,&quot; said Les Denend, president and chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
